      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I'm aware of a mod that places a predownload button. It also shows an icon above the Mic icon that gets filled in as it downloads.\nThen, when its done, it'll show a window saying (paraphrased):\n\"Your download is done, you can go back to the page (button offered which takes you back to the page) or dismiss this window.\"\nPlacement wise, the button appears in the World page, next to Drop Portal and in the Friend Profile page, above Join.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
