  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "So right now this is kind of in the game, but it would be nice to have this as an actual feature.\nSo right now if you hit the go home button when downloading a world it will keep downloading but in the background.\n\nSo it would be nice to have a button for this, as well as for portals.\nYou could just select a placed portal and click on predownload map.\nSo if its a bigger map you can just have it download in the background and you dont have to sit in the loading screen doing nothing.",
